  "notes": "Broadly covers making things accessible to the public — films, buildings, information, documents.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{一般|いっぱん}→一般：01737_ippan⟧{公開|こうかい} (open to the general public)\n- ⟦{情報|じょうほう}→情報：03348_jouhou⟧{公開|こうかい} (information disclosure)\n- {公開|こうかい}{日|び} (release date)\n- {公開|こうかい}{中|ちゅう} (now showing / currently open)\n- ⟦{非公開|ひこうかい}→非公開：16599_hikoukai⟧ (private, closed to the public)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {公開|こうかい}: making something accessible to the public (films, facilities, information)\n- ⟦{発表|はっぴょう}→発表：03562_happyou⟧: announcing or presenting (results, plans, research)\n- ⟦{公表|こうひょう}→公表：11640_kouhyou⟧: officially making information public (formal announcements)",
